    THEN JUST TRUE
    ELSE NOTHING   -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): "may keep the names and particulars relating to persons who have ceased to be members of the company separately" (a grant limited to former members; the grant ruling of 2026-11-12, limit 1)

