    `period: the last day of a period after` `the day on which an alteration is made in the register of members` 14 Days

-- src:17173 | Index of members of public company
-- src:17175 | (5) Every public company having more than 50 members must,
-- src:17176 | unless the register of members is in such a form as to constitute in
-- src:17177 | itself an index, keep an index in convenient form of the names of the
