-- (4): "as soon as possible" names no number: transmitting each entry takes the section's own standard of time as the input `the period the standard of time allows, as found`, so a late transmission reaches BREACH (s 52 does not apply); keeping the duplicate (MAINTENANCE) takes none.
-- src:17390 | (4) The public company must transmit to the office at which its
-- src:17391 | principal register is kept a copy of every entry in its branch register as
